<section class="tips-content win95-text" aria-labelledby="tips-heading">
  <h3 id="tips-heading" class="tips-title">Nate95 Help Topics</h3>
  <div class="tips-panel win95-sunken">
    <section class="tips-topic">
      <h4>Getting around</h4>
      <p>Open an icon, then move, minimize, or maximize its window. The Start menu is still useful, too.</p>
    </section>
    <section class="tips-topic">
      <h4>Keyboard shortcuts</h4>
      <p>Some old shortcuts still work here. If you know the classics, try them.</p>
    </section>
    <section class="tips-topic">
      <h4>Explore the desktop</h4>
      <p>This desktop responds to more than left-clicks. Try the space around the icons, not just the icons themselves.</p>
    </section>
    <section class="tips-topic last">
      <h4>Take your time</h4>
      <p>Leave the machine alone for a minute. It might find something to do.</p>
    </section>
  </div>
</section>

